    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090030/extras/fe3440d4255d4ea1b0249e0f7b481b1e.webp?t=1677241602\" /></div><br><strong>BlackBox</strong> is about an air crash investigator in the 90s, you are seated at your office desk where you go through mundane work until you stumble upon an old mysterious and tragic case which took place in 1982. Sift through files, search the database by typing relevant keywords, and listen to the cockpit voice recordings and case interviews in order to gather data to find out what happened.<strong> A game that asks you to listen.</strong><br><br><strong><i> Solve the mystery through careful examination of evidence in this investigative journey.</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How does it work?</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090030/extras/226e5a8db20e78d680bae3155011c90a.avif?t=1677241602\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090030/extras/c01bbd07832e558efa0e627bb78a2ae1.avif?t=1677241602\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090030/extras/91a9b990d86a42a7743ff21490e8b82a.poster.avif?t=1677241602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090030/extras/91a9b990d86a42a7743ff21490e8b82a.webm?t=1677241602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090030/extras/91a9b990d86a42a7743ff21490e8b82a.mp4?t=1677241602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090030/extras/a2ecec07